// The sibling half of partial_workflow_dispatch.mh — see that file for the
// primary declaration and the explanation. Pulled in there via a whole-file
// `import "..."` (no braces), which merges every declaration here, not just
// exported ones — a fragment has no individual name to `export`.
//
// Linted or opened on its own (nothing here pulls Dispatch back in), this
// file's `partial workflow Discovery` has no `entry` step — expected, not a
// bug, and `mhl lint` stays quiet about it here specifically because it
// can't tell that apart from a genuinely forgotten `entry`; see the LONE
// FRAGMENT note in Docs-Reference.dc.html#pipeline.
partial workflow Discovery {
    step Gate {
        var reached = true
    }
}
